    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/3f114388a71c30262c79e3e2ef72d32a.poster.avif?t=1739984040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/3f114388a71c30262c79e3e2ef72d32a.webm?t=1739984040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/3f114388a71c30262c79e3e2ef72d32a.mp4?t=1739984040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Angry Cat</strong> will involve you in a tense and fun adventure. Test your reflexes, strategies, motor skills with each challenge to complete and win the challenges if you can!<br><br>You will use the mouse and keyboard to control each of the cats facing puzzles, dangerous enemies, and various traps. Help the kitty couple along the paths to victory in over 20 unique and challenging levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/21f9db5bb6e149f5d30ad0bb8b30f2e9.avif?t=1739984040\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/c48f908487193686e07467668a6f92a0.poster.avif?t=1739984040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/c48f908487193686e07467668a6f92a0.webm?t=1739984040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/c48f908487193686e07467668a6f92a0.mp4?t=1739984040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426540/extras/53bc1efcb104cf0f0760e1583